1010	{"artifactId":"LLD-b7a68147dcf72034-s5","entry":{"id":"86b44efde6c9430eaa271be37244009b","actor":{"id":"insrc:approval","kind":"system","properties":{}},"timestamp":"2026-10-25T13:31:30.247Z","operation":"approve","revision":{"number":10,"contentHash":"c6ceba4a38dc59ceff68a28b19ae351d53bc76e001b13f97c28e660e9e59bb28"},"status":{"from":"draft","to":"approved"},"outcome":{"result":"override","summary":"User-directed override (2026-10-25). LLD-s5 went through ten revisions and nine daemon review rounds; every finding through round 9 was fixed or decided by the user (extraArgs kept, gist content replacement and codespace cp --expand accepted as exclusions). Revision 10 fixes the last three round-9 findings (release download selector, codespace notice in the gate preview, one failure precedence) but was not re-reviewed. The user explicitly asked to fix the issues and approve with override; the input-inventory, real-CLI parser and prompt-sweep tests and the post-build code review remain as checks."}}}
